.page realpath 1 print an absolute, tidy path

# SYNOPSIS
*realpath* _PATH_...

# DESCRIPTION
`realpath` prints each _PATH_ as an absolute path with `.` and `..` components and repeated slashes removed, resolving relative paths against the current directory. It does not follow symbolic links and does not check that the path exists.

# EXAMPLES
    realpath ../Hakurei//etc/./passwd
    realpath .

# SEE ALSO
readlink(1), basename(1), dirname(1)
